### Issue description

When executing tests using the `proptest` strategies over `Scalar::cast_with_options()`, a bug was found. The bug occurs when casting a Scalar with an out-of-range datetime value. The operation panics instead of returning a error.

### Expected behavior

Should not panic. 

### Installed versions

polars = "0.52.0"

